sentences.text:
8. In the result, the following ORDER i) The petition is allowed.
ii) The petitioner is granted bail in Special Case (POCSO) No.129/2024 arising out of Crime No.513/2023 of Malur Police Station registered for offences punishable under Sections 376(3), 313,
506 IPC and Section 6 of the Protection of children from Sexual Offences Act, 2012 pending on the file of Additional District and Sessions Judge, FTSC-1, POCSO, Kolar subject to following conditions;
a) The petitioner -accused shall execute a personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/- with one NC:
2025:KHC:44396 HC-KAR surety for the like sum to the satisfaction of the trial Court;
b) The petitioner -accused attend the trial Court on all dates of hearing unless exempted and co- operate for speedy disposal of the case;

